<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Internal Services</title>
    <style>
      :root { color-scheme: light dark; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }
      body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; }
      main { width: min(46rem, calc(100% - 2rem)); }
      h1 { margin-bottom: .5rem; }
      .note { opacity: .75; line-height: 1.5; }
      ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: .75rem; }
      a { display: block; padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid #8886; border-radius: .6rem; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
      a:hover, a:focus-visible { border-color: #4285f4; outline: none; }
      small { display: block; opacity: .7; margin-top: .25rem; }
      code { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>Internal Services</h1>
      <p class="note">Standard HTTP URLs are redirected to HTTPS. Trust the organization CA on this device to avoid certificate warnings.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/gitlab">GitLab<small>Source code and collaboration</small></a></li>
        <li><a href="/svn/">SVN<small>Version control</small></a></li>
        <li><a href="/outline/">Outline<small>Knowledge base</small></a></li>
        <li><a href="/dex">Dex<small>Employee sign-in</small></a></li>
        <li><a href="/ldap/">LLDAP<small>Directory administration</small></a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="note">LDAP clients use <code>ldap://{{SERVER_HOST}}:13890</code>; LDAP is a TCP protocol, not an HTTP path.</p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
